qping (2.2) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Upload historical data on a daily basis, rather than all at once
  * Added the ability to set the response waiting time.
  * Added mute or mute - for a specific host - i.e. continue to check, but do not notify about problems.
  * Migration from the old version ~/.ping_monitor_history has been removed.json
  * Y-axis with latency
  * Dark theme
  * Down/Warn clickable — the click switches filter_failed.
  * Tray and notifications
    - A badge with the number of down hosts on the tray icon.
    - Grouping notifications. If 5 hosts have fallen in a row, one "5 hosts down" notification is sent
  * Compact/expanded graphics mode. 
  * Simplified the ability to add new languages
  * Keyboard shortcuts 
    - Ctrl+F Focus on Search
    - Ctrl+R Changing the graph mode display (Compact -> Normal -> Ext)
  * BugFix: the focus on the found servers is not saved when using the search
  * BugFix: fix the renaming problem: if the host has been renamed (edit_host), the history directory remains under the old name.

 -- Sergei Parhomenko <zersh@mail.ru>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:09:52 +0300

